<% content_for :title, "Today" %>

<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
<section class="mb-8">
  <p class="text-sm font-medium text-teal-700"><%= @now.strftime("%A, %-d %B") %> · Day <%= @day_number %></p>
  <h1 class="mt-1 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
    <%= greeting_for(@now) %>, <%= Current.user.first_name %>.
  </h1>
</section>

<section class="mb-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
  <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-500">Next session</p>
  <p class="mt-1 text-lg font-medium">One 10-minute session is today's whole goal.</p>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-stone-500">Starting is the win. Length comes later.</p>

  <button type="button" disabled
          class="mt-5 inline-flex w-full cursor-not-allowed items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-stone-200 px-4 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-stone-500 sm:w-auto sm:px-8">
    Start 10 minutes
  </button>
  <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-stone-400">The focus timer arrives in the next milestone. Use your phone timer until then.</p>
</section>

<section class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-stone-300 p-6">
  <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-stone-700">Coming to this page</h2>
  <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-600">
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">1.</span> Today's plan: subjects, topics and tasks in time slots</li>
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">2.</span> Focus timer with a 10 → 20 → 25 minute ladder</li>
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">3.</span> "Are you focused?" check-ins on your phone and watch</li>
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">4.</span> Phone, laptop and watch data in one daily report</li>
  </ul>
</section>
</div>
